~~ Public | We use linguistic theory to understand how LLMs and humans answer questions.  They're quite different: LLMs don't push back, humans share more personal experience.  We hope to use this to guide LLMs to create answers to questions that are more human: safer, more discursive, more engaging, and maybe even funnier.